  "body": "### Describe the bug\n\nThe weather widget seems to work fine from a setup perspective - can select a city and configure the widget without issue.  But upon saving, the widget simply displays \"No integration data available.\"  Tried a few different cities as well.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAdd weather widget to a board, configure and save.\n\n### Impact\n\nJust impacting this widget as far as I know\n\n### Additional information\n\nCurrently on 1.76.0 but also saw this issue on 1.75.0.  That version was the first I noticed the issue.  It worked for me in earlier versions.\n\n### Version\n\n1.76.0\n\n### Installation method\n\nDocker Compose\n\n### Browser\n\n_No response_",
